{"4162460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Resistance Racing 2k97", "steam_appid": 4162460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/0cd197eb73161b2c48664951a5e91962.avif?t=1787675634\" alt=\"resistance racing 2k97 logo\" width=640 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to <strong>rip through</strong> abandoned <strong>hyperloops</strong> and other postapocalyptic <strong>underground</strong> structures <strong>at break neck speeds</strong> to win the last seat in a rocket to mars - or so you are made to believe at least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/34346f050c53fa8c8b87c6f2be3967b9.poster.avif?t=1787675634\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/34346f050c53fa8c8b87c6f2be3967b9.webm?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/34346f050c53fa8c8b87c6f2be3967b9.mp4?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A rich elite has driven humanity underground in the wake of earths climate collapsing. Huge underground structures have been built to house humanity. A whole generation has never seen sunlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass the time and to possible gain a better life underground a racing leage was created: <strong>Formula Zero</strong>. To win the championship is to escape earth. But the game is rigged. Who is to be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/87ea10136e1c83b739d9b45ee420b4db.avif?t=1787675634\" alt=\"\"width=640 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/e5671d3b2ef0841489543d72beb9c858.webp?t=1787675634\" alt=\"superfast zero-g obstacle avoidance banner in red\" width=640 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk</strong> to the other inhabitants that work for the leage or race themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> the hidden truth behind the leage or escape to an uncertain future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your craft to try and keep up with your rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in the <strong>Resistance</strong> to bring down the leage and its upperclass leaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race</strong> to regain your freedom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/f33bee3e37b697fbd7344c54319b7742.poster.avif?t=1787675634\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/f33bee3e37b697fbd7344c54319b7742.webm?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/f33bee3e37b697fbd7344c54319b7742.mp4?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your new home in first person. Talk to people and fulfill their quests to uncover more of this underground world. Jump into your antigravity craft and rip through the tunnels to progress in the leage. Find the perfect balance of slipstreaming your opponents, hugging the tunnelwalls, dodging obstacles and managing heat to get the highest speeds. Winning is not everything though.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/0cd197eb73161b2c48664951a5e91962.avif?t=1787675634\" alt=\"resistance racing 2k97 logo\" width=640 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to <strong>rip through</strong> abandoned <strong>hyperloops</strong> and other postapocalyptic <strong>underground</strong> structures <strong>at break neck speeds</strong> to win the last seat in a rocket to mars - or so you are made to believe at least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/34346f050c53fa8c8b87c6f2be3967b9.poster.avif?t=1787675634\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/34346f050c53fa8c8b87c6f2be3967b9.webm?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/34346f050c53fa8c8b87c6f2be3967b9.mp4?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A rich elite has driven humanity underground in the wake of earths climate collapsing. Huge underground structures have been built to house humanity. A whole generation has never seen sunlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass the time and to possible gain a better life underground a racing leage was created: <strong>Formula Zero</strong>. To win the championship is to escape earth. But the game is rigged. Who is to be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/87ea10136e1c83b739d9b45ee420b4db.avif?t=1787675634\" alt=\"\"width=640 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/e5671d3b2ef0841489543d72beb9c858.webp?t=1787675634\" alt=\"superfast zero-g obstacle avoidance banner in red\" width=640 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk</strong> to the other inhabitants that work for the leage or race themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> the hidden truth behind the leage or escape to an uncertain future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your craft to try and keep up with your rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in the <strong>Resistance</strong> to bring down the leage and its upperclass leaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race</strong> to regain your freedom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/f33bee3e37b697fbd7344c54319b7742.poster.avif?t=1787675634\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/f33bee3e37b697fbd7344c54319b7742.webm?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/extras/f33bee3e37b697fbd7344c54319b7742.mp4?t=1787675634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your new home in first person. Talk to people and fulfill their quests to uncover more of this underground world. Jump into your antigravity craft and rip through the tunnels to progress in the leage. Find the perfect balance of slipstreaming your opponents, hugging the tunnelwalls, dodging obstacles and managing heat to get the highest speeds. Winning is not everything though.</p>", "short_description": "Prepare to rip through abandoned hyperloops and other postapocalyptic underground structures at break neck speeds to win the last seat in a rocket that takes you away from an earth where the climate collapse drove humanity underground.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/3d0533de1c88dd876875d3c5a2ff165f033132e4/header.jpg?t=1787675634", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/8d2f163eb7002264951bf87b90cc4ab5475e383d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787675634", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162460/8d2f163eb7002264951bf87b90cc4ab5475e383d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787675634", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Ancient Pixel"], "publishers": ["Ancient Pixel"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "descri